// MAME debugger init script — m68k execution trace
// Usage: run_neogeosdk_trace.bat  (or add -debugscript dump\mame_trace.mds to mame command)
// Output: dump\m68k_trace.txt
//
// When MAME halts on a 68000 exception the trace file contains every
// instruction executed up to the crash.  The last ~20 lines pinpoint
// the faulting PC and the call chain above it.
trace dump\m68k_trace.txt,maincpu,noloop
g
